  messages:
  - '<b>Welcome to Bruno''s VR Room!</b>


    Press Next to learn the controls.'
  - '<b>Grab and use</b>


    Grab things with the grip button.

    Use them with
    the trigger.'
  - '<b>Move around</b>


    Hold A / X or touch a thumbstick,

    aim, then let
    go to teleport.'
  - '<b>Menu</b>


    Press B any time to open the menu.

    Visit the VR Room
    or reset this room.'
